{"unit_id":"EvilIrving__dsh-repro#card-zh","repo":"EvilIrving/dsh-repro","commit":"e51736ba583830462e0cca4d808ec3e0b7001bcd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-repro 是一个 DSH 命令插件，通过 /repro 将当前会话导出为可复现的问题包。它读取会话持久化服务中的事件和元数据，对事件值递归脱敏，汇总失败工具调用、版本信息，并在可用时收集当前工作目录的 git diff，最后写出 JSON 文件。输出包包含格式版本、会话头、事件、失败命令、差异和版本字段。适合需要保存调试上下文并在之后复查会话问题的 DSH 用户；命令仅返回生成文件的路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:85-109","lib/scrub.js:53-66"]}
{"unit_id":"EvilIrving__dsh-repro#card-en","repo":"EvilIrving/dsh-repro","commit":"e51736ba583830462e0cca4d808ec3e0b7001bcd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-repro exports a DSH session problem bundle with /repro. It reads session events, redacts credential-like values, collects failed tool calls and version details, and adds git diff when subprocess is available. The JSON file goes to the chosen directory; the command returns its path.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:85-109","lib/scrub.js:53-66"]}
